42
00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:56.907
Whether lines in space are parallel or
perpendicular

43
00:03:56.907 --> 00:03:59.420
is determined by their direction vectors:

44
00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:06.120
two lines are parallel if their direction
vectors s₁ and s₂

45
00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:11.700
